// Base growth after loading .tzdb (test 217 - in one session): node derivatives are labeled in journal
// (j_derived), playback puts them in a pool - open base elaboration takes the former, rather than producing
// new ones (§7.4). The first parsing after download was +63 node.
// program: db_growth.tz
open_view module
idle
journal
save_to out/growth.tzdb
reopen out/growth.tzdb
// Reproduced journal - the same (marked derivatives - also in it)
journal
// expect: журнал: +0 записей ()
open_view module
idle
journal
// expect-not: j_add
// expect-not: j_derived
idle
journal
// expect: журнал: +0 записей ()
